                <pb facs="0685" n="679" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg679"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Baron
                            Ketteler.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Referring to Mr. Adee’s note of August 1, regarding appointment of Mr. Ide as
                    chief justice of Samoa, I beg to refer also to your legation’s note of July 8,
                    and to say that this Government concurs in the appointment of Mr. Schmidt as
                    president of council.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
